Description:It is your first main phase. You control Goblin King (other Goblins get +1/+1 and mountainwalk; it came under your control this turn and is summoning sick) and Woodland Changeling (2/2 changeling). The opponent is at 3 life and controls a Mountain and an untapped Wall of Stone (0/8). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-changeling-lord-landwalk | Changeling gives every creature type (CR 702.73a), so Goblin King makes Woodland Changeling a 3/3 with mountainwalk, unblockable while the opponent controls a Mountain (CR 702.14c); without the King's bonus the 2/2 Changeling is blocked by the Wall or falls one short
